        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I finally have everything set up in my computer/cat room (see attached), and thought I'd use it as an instigator for folks sharing their GTG-related geekery. :-D</p>\r\n\r\n<p>FYI: The black-and-white image with Absolute Zero on it that's below the OblivAeon poster is something Adam scribbled on a plastic table cloth while he was bored at a con. (That's something that rarely happens anymore! ;-)&nbsp;In case you can't read it, it says \"Absolute Zero is Excited\". When I told him I wasn't going to let it get thrown out, he signed it.&nbsp;The art to the right of it is the print from the 2014 Gathering of Heroes event at GTG HQ.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you have anything you've created like custom boxes, hanging of stuff, whatever, share here and give folks ideas for things they might consider doing themselves! (I know there are folks who have shared things in the past, but those threads were from years ago and a lot of the newer folks have probably never seen them.)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(And yeah, the shelves are for the cats. There are shelves and other things all over the room for them to get up and around. I could babble about that for a while, but it's not pertinent to this. ;-)&nbsp;</p>",
