        "created_at": "2019-01-02T09:37:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That's fantastic! The cat shelves actually give it a bit of a museum feel, like I expect them to have action figures still in their packages on them.</p>\n<p>I've framed my art prints, though I do have the Sentinels Gen Con 2016 booth banner hanging between my desk and my kallax shelves at home. I'm not there or I'd take a picture as well.</p>",
