        "created_at": "2019-01-05T17:07:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>When I backed Box Throne on Kickstarter to store all my games, I knew exactly what I wanted to do to dress up the acrylic toppers. I laid out some extra dividers I had and poured epoxy resin over top of it to seal them in. It gave the topper done extra strength and showed my love for Sentinels.</p>",
